  "hypothesis": "Renamed JS cave initialization/pass calls or per-pass buffers might change full unjoined generation compared with C mkmap composition.",
  "expectedBehavior": "With the same legal initialization draws, all active C phases and JS production phases yield identical terrain and metadata; smoothing changes outputs without consuming additional RNG.",
  "observedBehavior": "Twenty-four smoothed targets and24 unsmoothed controls: four seeds3/19/43/101 \u00d7three foreground/background pairsROOM/STONE,CORR/TREE,ICE/WATER \u00d7lit0/1. Supported public JS des.level_init(mines) executes the whole production pipeline. Its observed legal rn2/rnd tape drives exact compiled C mkmap,init_map,init_fill,get_map,all three passes andfinish_map. Every one of1,680 cells matches on typ,lit,roomno andicedpool, and C consumes the entire tape with exact operation/bound checks. All24 paired controls have identical tapes but different output hashes.",
  "witness": {
    "kind": "compiled_oracle",
    "scope": "Twenty-four smoothed targets and24 unsmoothed controls: four seeds3/19/43/101 \u00d7three foreground/background pairsROOM/STONE,CORR/TREE,ICE/WATER \u00d7lit0/1. Supported public JS des.level_init(mines) executes the whole production pipeline. Its observed legal rn2/rnd tape drives exact compiled C mkmap,init_map,init_fill,get_map,all three passes andfinish_map. Every one of1,680 cells matches on typ,lit,roomno andicedpool, and C consumes the entire tape with exact operation/bound checks. All24 paired controls have identical tapes but different output hashes.",
    "limitations": [
      "Eleven keys form ONE unjoined pipeline/buffer-delegation cause. Five C phase edges and five renamed JS edges are not ten independent findings. Temporary storage equivalence is logical output under successful allocation only, not JS GC timing or C OOM handling.",
      "The new question is pipeline composition and phase ordering from a shared initial random fill, not another isolated cellular-pass or finishing-metadata sample. Existing phase/metadata proofs remain scoped and are not recounted. Target smoothed=true executes two pass_three iterations; paired smoothed=false controls omit those iterations with identical RNG tapes.",
      "Four seeds3/19/43/101,three foreground/background pairsROOM/STONE,CORR/TREE,ICE/WATER,lit0/1 comprise24targets and24controls. Each run compares all1,680 cells including unused column0 on typ,lit,roomno andicedpool. Inputs are fresh construction levels,joined=false,walled=false,icedpools=false. No rooms are created.",
      "JS executes production newgame_pre_mklev and public des.level_init(mines) via mklev specialLevelLoader, then stops before finish. C executes exact mkmap and all active callees from a valid typed lev_init descriptor. The Lua argument reader, C full startup and independent dungeon initialization are not compared. No private JS function is extracted.",
      "JS RNG tracing supplies legal rn2/rnd values to C, which checks every operation and bound and consumes the entire tape. This demonstrates equal behavior under shared draws; it does NOT establish C/JS RNG generator equivalence. Full raw tapes are reproducibly regenerated by the runner rather than published as bulky artifacts.",
      "Joining and wallification are disabled and C hooks abort if reached. No join-map cleanup,cap exit,room topology,walls,negative-light/depth RNG,reused metadata,allocator failure,full finalization or runtime claim. Cave-cap remains parked; no new seed sweep attempts its reachability.",
      "Source hashes and C bodies are pinned. All tested JS caller/helper bodies remain equal to the frozen scan base; immutable run identities and official export projection are preserved. Main advanced to f3e2e6d63; the reusable clean checkout was updated safely and target/control/layout rerun. No gameplay edits or acceptance inference for Main publications.",
      "Four diagnostic keys,ten changed-caller bindings,bottomstairs,cave-cap and three parked prerequisite gaps remain unresolved and untouched. All access/safety exclusions remain in force."
    ]
